{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/120-gao-qiu/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/120-gao-qiu/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 羔裘 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 唐風 · 羔裘 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《羔裘》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"120-gao-qiu","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/120-gao-qiu/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"120-gao-qiu","title":"羔裘","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"tangfeng","path":["風","唐風","羔裘"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"羔裘豹袪","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"自我人居居","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"豈無他人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"維子之故","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"羔裘豹褎","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"自我人究究","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"豈無他人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"維子之好","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"刺在位不能恤民也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《羔裘》二章，章四句。此篇「羔裘豹袪」，指卿大夫而言也無疑。即下云「豈無他人？維子之故」，亦其民欲去而不忍去之意也亦無疑。民欲去其大夫而不忍去，則其大夫之賢否可知，即民情亦大可見。「居居」、「究究」，義雖難詳，理實可參。且見《爾雅》，自足爲據。而朱子乃謂《爾雅》是集諸儒訓詁成書，其間容或有誤，遂廢斯篇而不釋。夫訓詁原集古訓以爲詁，既以《爾雅》爲不足信，則又何所信乎？即此亦見其矯强自用。輔氏以爲得闕疑，意恐不免有門户回護之見也。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"羔裘豹袪。〔《集傳》〕君純羔，大夫以豹飾。袪，袂也。〔孔氏穎達曰〕袂是袖之大名，袪是袖頭之小稱，其通皆爲袂也。自居居。〔毛氏萇曰〕自，用也。居居，懷惡不相親比之貌。褎猶袂也。究究。〔毛氏萇曰〕究究，猶居居也。〔《釋訓》云〕居居、究究，惡也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"袪六魚。居同。故七遇，音叶古慕反。叶韻。褎二十六宥。究同。好二十號，叶呼候反。叶韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
